        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "This is an **operational** view. The authoritative record of every decision is the immutable domain artifact on disk \u2014 the research report, the strategy decision, the risk evaluation, the execution record, the realised result.\n\nMetrics here carry **no domain identifiers**: an execution id as a metric label is one time series per trade. To go from a number to a trade, open the trace, read `trading.execution.id` off the span, and look the artifact up with `execution explain --execution-id \u2026`.\n\nA panel showing **No data** means the metric has not been emitted, not that the value is zero. Telemetry ships disabled; enable it in `config/observability.yaml`."
